~ start_nazi_encounter
if Inv_UI.player_has_item("Soda Machine",1) and Inv_UI.player_has_item("Foldable Table",1)
	*You have the required items to continue
	do get_tree().current_scene.find_child("nazi_intro_CS", true, false).start_cs()
elif Inv_UI.player_has_item("Soda Machine",1)
	*You need to get that foldable table to continue
elif Inv_UI.player_has_item("Foldable Table",1)
	*You need to get that purple soda machine to continue
else
	*You need some items to continue
=> END